{{page dlc|r}}
Item tags are internal metadata, like [[Item quality]], that were added in Repentance. The tags are used to create groups of items which are used in a few different ways.

== Examples ==
* [[Planetarium]] uses items tagged [[Item Tags stars|stars]] for its unlock condition.
* [[The Lost]]'s [[Birthright]] rerolls items tagged [[Item Tags nolostbr|nolostbr]].
* [[Tainted Lost]] can only find items tagged [[Item Tags offensive|offensive]].

